WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:01.480
What?!

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.480
You want to enroll at Seton Academy?

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.640
Yes. I've become somewhat 
interested in it.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.690
Would you allow me to observe the school?

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.150
Of course! I'm sure you'll like it!

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.540
You're more than welcome to observe.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.700
You know, you've come at the perfect time!

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.490
<b>On the XXth of OO 
10:00 AM ~ 3:00 PM 
* Last entry: 2:30 PM</b>

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.830
<b>Eat or
\h\h Be Eaten</b>

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.570
Our school festival is coming up soon,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.830
<b>Culture Festival</b>

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.830
so everyone's in high spir—

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.830
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.080
Headmaster!

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.140
Pardon me, but I have one question.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.090
What is it?

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.260
T-T-Terano-sensei... w-water...

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.470
I heard that there were human students here.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.010
U-Um... w-w-water... Terano-sensei...

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:36.910
Ah, yes. Mazama and Hino from the cooking club.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.020
H-Hey, Terano! Water!

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:53.010
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.010
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.630
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.730
<b>Seton Academy Record 10     A Gentle Savage</b>

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.480
<b>Culture Festival!!</b>

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:19.140
The cooking club, huh?

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:23.950
That's...

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.530
Ranka-chan!

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:27.510
Please go out with me!

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.180
<b>Guardian of Hell</b>

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.180
<b>Only take damage from attacks by creatures
 that attack in groups of three or more.</b>

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:45.630
Kuroe-san's got...

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.490
...a combo!

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:51.150
That's nothing! I'm gonna 
use this rare card!

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.330
Observing?

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:51.150
Yes.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.270
Take that!

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.340
Um, you said your name was Anetani-san?

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:57.150
Not bad. In that case, I'll use... this!

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.300
Are you interested in cooking?

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.150
Yes.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.860
Thanks! You're welcome to observe us!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:02:59.860
<i>She's...</i>

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.640
<i>a human female!</i>

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:02.490
Let's have fun cooking together!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.190
Hey, what kind of animal are you?

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:06.070
I'm a human.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:07.740
Oh, a human!

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:08.330
Huh?!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.330
What?!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.900
It's true! She has human ears!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:13.920
And no tail!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.230
Human?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.700
What is it, Hitomi-san?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.050
Oh, I...

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:24.700
I've never met another human girl before.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.370
Really?

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.350
S-So...

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.030
C-Can I call you "An-chan"?

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:35.120
I'm Hino Hitomi. You can call me Hitomi.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.090
Nice to meet you.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:36.900
Likewise.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.010
The next world championship is mine!

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.030
That's our Kuroe-san!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.700
No doubt about it!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.700
Are there other members?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.690
Oh... Yeah, there are two more,

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:47.220
but Ranka-chan just went into heat.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.290
Heat?

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.670
Ranka-san is our boss.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:54.140
We thought she was just keeping 
quiet in her dorm room,

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:57.500
but with just one day left 
in her heat cycle...

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.300
I can go out for just a little while, right?

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:03.470
Yay!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:12.190
<i>The pheromones emitted by female 
wolves and other dogs</i>

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:16.610
<i>can quickly spread across a range 
as broad as two kilometers.</i>

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.100
What the heck...

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:31.910
Why?!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:38.920
So now she's being dragged around 
by Jin-san as they run for their lives.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.140
Will they... be okay?

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.800
I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.550
Still, I'm worried...

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.490
<i>So the one who passed by me earlier...</i>

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.390
<i>really was a human male.</i>

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.240
Is something wrong?

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:55.150
If you're worried about this "Ranka-chan,"
 I don't think you need to be.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.900
Wh-What the woof is that human female's deal?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.820
Why do I have to go through 
this for a dumb mutt?

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:11.650
I think we lost them, but we need to 
take cover while we have the chance.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:12.870
Jin-kun, over here!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.460
You can hide in this storage shed!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.710
Got it!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.610
Boy, that was a close one.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:26.650
You said it.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.790
Bunch of stupid dogs in rut...

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.550
Rest in here for a while.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:33.160
Yeah. I don't know who you are, but thank—

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.390
Wait!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.290
It's you?!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.100
Come, Jin...

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.730
Let's talk about love on this bed!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.490
H-Hell no!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.620
Nii-san, please make it count today!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.280
Love's free throw!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.640
And then, love's dunk shot!

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.340
Jin!

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.420
Give me a break!

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.550
That was too close in a lot of ways.

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.550
That just made me sweat even more...

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.090
Damn it, you always cause so much trouble.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.780
Just lay low until tomorrow, would you?

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.060
Animals, I swear...

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.520
Wait... d-don't tell me...

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.590
<b>In Heat</b>

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.590
<b>In Heat</b>

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.590
<b>In Heat</b>

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.590
<b>In Heat</b>

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.590
<b>In Heat</b>

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:23.590
<b>In Heat</b>

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.730
Don't! Stay away!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.210
Jin-san still isn't back.

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:35.050
Maybe he's in... Ranka-chan's room.

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:38.240
Maybe they're making babies together!

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.500
I really don't think so.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.920
I wonder what it's like to be in heat.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.190
<i>Pandas are not very skilled 
at reproductive behavior.</i>

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:52.050
<b>S</b>

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:51.010
<i>There's even such a thing as "panda porn,"
 for helping pandas breed in captivity.</i>

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.930
I wanna know what it's like!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.310
Idols don't need to know about that!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.310
Jin... Let's do it.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.570
<b>Lick Lick Lick Lick Lick Lick</b>

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.320
That's the same stupid thing you always do!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.860
Jeez... Give it a rest already.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.750
Dumb dogs only need to get 
along with other dumb dogs.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:22.680
Seriously, why do I always have to...

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.450
Jin...

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:29.880
Jin, do you... hate me?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.970
Yep, I hate you.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.840
It took you this long to realize it?

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:38.460
I hate all animals.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.980
A-Anyway!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:48.190
Just stay in here until tomorrow!

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.030
It's done!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.580
We'll be serving this at the cultural festival.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.080
Would you taste test them for us, An-chan?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.810
We might've made a little too much.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:03.940
Thank you for the meal.

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.300
That was fast!

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.000
Where's mine?!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.070
D-Did you like it?

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.230
There wasn't enough.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:10.960
Not enough?!

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:13.360
You're quite the eater!

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.970
We're really happy that you ate so much!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.940
Why don't we just run an 
all-you-can-eat restaurant for the festival?

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.440
Oh, that sounds fun!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:21.560
I'm in!

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.420
What do you think we should do?

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:25.560
Getting all the ingredients 
won't be easy...

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.050
Oh, welcome back.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.710
That's Mazama Jin-kun.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.130
Who's that animal?

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:35.780
She's here to observe us. 
Her name's Anetani An-chan.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.280
She's a human girl.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.110
What? Human?

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:42.490
I see! Nice to meet you!

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:48.610
<b>Animal Alliance</b>

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.700
Hey, isn't he being unusually nice?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.690
Not at all like how he is with us!

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.660
How strange!

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:48.960
Shut up, animals!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:52.130
By the way, Jin-kun, how's Ranka-chan doing?

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.370
Uh, she's fine...

00:08:53.720 --> 00:09:02.520
<b>Animal Alliance</b>

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:57.660
What, what? Did something 
happen with Ranka?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.980
All alone with a female in heat?

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.140
How suspicious!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:04.310
Nothing happened.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.520
<i>Something happened!</i>

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:10.620
Well, Jin-kun, since 
Ranka-chan's not here today,

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:12.810
and Miyubi-chan's dead...

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.780
I say we conclude club activities for the day

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.110
and work together to clean up.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.620
Okay!

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:41.710
<i>I feel like she's been looking at me a lot.</i>

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.060
<i>Could she be...</i>

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.130
Mazama-kun...

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.900
Anetani... san?

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:57.280
I'm very interested in you.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.550
Interested... in me?

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:00.280
Yes.

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.010
Sorry!

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:04.660
Huh?

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:08.210
I understand that you like me.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:08.670
Huh?

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.180
As happy as I am to be liked be a human female,

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:11.540
What?

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.290
I can't return your feelings.

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:13.920
Huh?!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.700
Because... Hitomi-chan's the only one for me!

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.300
Sorry!

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:23.390
<i>Wh...</i>

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.890
<i>Why do I feel like I was just rejected?!</i>

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:30.900
Sheesh...

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.010
Don't go misunderstanding me!

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:34.060
An-chan...

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.570
U-Um... If you don't mind,

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.570
why don't we spend a little 
more time together?

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:42.930
<i>Perfect.</i>

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:44.430
I'd love to.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.330
I'm really glad.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:52.460
I didn't know what I'd do 
if you turned me down.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:55.490
<i>What a fool. Her guard is completely down.</i>

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:55.820
I bet you're surprised to find out 
our school has a hot spring, huh?

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:56.960
<i>But that aside...</i>

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.950
We all made it together.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.470
<i>Damned human!</i>

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:02.780
<i>The only species whose breasts remain 
large even when not lactating</i>

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:05.450
<i>are dairy cattle and humans.</i>

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:09.480
So, An-chan, what's your best subject?

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:10.100
None, really.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.650
What do you do on your days off?

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.950
What music do you like? And movies?

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:16.980
Oh, and what's your favorite food?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.940
Food...

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.310
Oh... I'm asking too many 
questions, aren't I?

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:25.270
I'm just so happy to meet 
a human girl. Sorry.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.140
Meat...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:26.790
Huh?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.710
I like... meat!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.080
An-cha—

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.400
What's wrong?

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:36.970
Shoot...

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:37.880
An-chan!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.310
Hang in there! An-chan!

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.630
<b>Gurrrrrgle</b>

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:45.640
<b>Gurrrrrgle</b>

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.330
You scared me, suddenly collapsing like that.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:53.720
I'm impressed you could tell I was hungry.

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.440
Y-Yeah, well...

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:58.150
That was delicious.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.380
I'm glad.

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:03.070
It's so late already.

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:06.950
We're both in pajamas already, 
so just spend the night here, okay?

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.200
Spend the night?

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:16.330
Why?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.700
Why are you so nice to me?

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.720
We only just met, and you hardly know me.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.650
That should be obvious.

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:29.100
Because I want us to be friends.

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.350
Friends...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:36.980
Thanks to Ranka-chan, I've made lots 
of friends in the cooking club.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:40.930
So I'd like to be friends with you, too.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.310
Goodnight.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.210
<i>Friends...</i>

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.830
<i>Humans are more complex than I imagined.</i>

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.330
<i>I'll need to investigate them further.</i>

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:56.080
<i>And the first thing I need 
to investigate is...</i>

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.230
Yep, I hate you.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.440
Jin's scent...

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.910
Jin!

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:34.550
I can't sleep now that Jin's on my mind.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:43.170
So tired...

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.470
Thank goodness. Looks like 
my heat cycle's over.

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:53.180
<b>Gurrrrrgle</b>

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.020
<b>Gurrrrrgle</b>

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.060
Feeling relieved always makes me hungry...

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.860
That smell...

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.580
M-Meat!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.570
Want some?

00:14:15.570 --> 00:14:18.290
W-Wolves don't need handouts from other...

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.820
An-chan...

