<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:39.380
<i>Donkey!</i>

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:45.860
Oh? You're a wolf, but you're 
dating a human male?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.430
