00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:53.100
<i>Red hair, white skin,</i>

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.610
<i>and pretty blue eyes...</i>

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:58.750
<i>Just what kind of animal is she?</i>

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.690
You should break up with him, then.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.770
Huh?

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.850
You can't trust humans.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:11.380
Unlike wolves, they'll betray their 
companions without a second thought.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.320
Also, humans are liars.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:19.020
They're lying, savage, cruel, 
self-centered creatures.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:23.900
Far more animals than you realize 
have gone extinct because of humans.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.150
Break up with him.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.030
Jin isn't like that.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.740
Jin isn't that kind of human.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.400
How can you be so su—

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:38.830
Besides, as his boss, I'd never
 allow him to betray me!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.070
That's right!

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:45.130
I'm his boss, so first thing tomorrow, 
I'm gonna ask him why he hates me!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.630
Um... What are you...

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:50.260
Thanks! The meat was great!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.580
Wait!

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:55.430
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:58.020
If this causes them to fight

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:01.550
and breaks up the humans' group, 
that works out perfectly.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.230
The reason?

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:11.010
Yeah. Tell me what it is you hate about me.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.570
He told her he hates her?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.610
What on earth...

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:17.740
...is gonna happen between them?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.030
I heard humans were cruel liars,

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:23.250
but I know you're not like that.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.690
So...

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.130
I am, though.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.880
You heard right.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:32.570
Humans will lie without a second thought.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.670
So don't take it so seriously.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:48.730
Don't take everything you're told so seriously.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:56.660
He means he was lying.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.690
He doesn't actually hate you.

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:00.660
Huh?!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.060
Jin!

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.700
I'm so glad!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:07.490
Cut it out, you dumb dog!

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:08.980
Isn't that great?

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:12.170
This is how... Ranka-chan should be.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.410
Wait, wasn't her heat cycle over?

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:16.260
Oh, well!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.140
Go ahead and make some babies!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.640
Oh, An-chan!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.780
You came back!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.390
An! Yay!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:27.650
Thanks!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.930
I made up with Jin, thanks to you!

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:34.150
I'll let you join my pack, too!

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:36.400
An-chan...

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:38.910
I guess she's our friend now, too, huh?

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.270
Uh-huh!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.980
Sorry. I just remembered something I have to do.

00:17:57.980 --> 00:17:59.100
I'll come again sometime.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:00.420
Okay, see you.

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:01.980
Zai jian!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:04.530
Come back for the cultural festival!

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:06.100
How about that?

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:09.100
I didn't know you were all 
friends with An, too!

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:11.110
She is... human, right?

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:09.770
Yeah, that's right.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.110
We are!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.410
It was kinda sudden...

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:15.670
Next time she asks me out, I should 
at least get some tea with her.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.610
<b>* Still has the wrong idea</b>

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.330
<i>I didn't succeed in breaking them up.</i>

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.620
<b>Darwin Academy</b>

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.130
<b>Extinct Department</b>

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.670
You're awfully late, Anetani-kun.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.580
You weren't making friends 
with the humans, were you?

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:39.660
Of course not.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:40.700
That's good.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:45.140
<b>Ando Andrew 
Mesonychia Triisodontidae Andrewsarchus andrewsarchus</b>

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.140
Humans are the enemy.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:49.270
<b>Yangyang 
Cetartiodactyla Lipotidae Lipotes vexillifer</b>

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:49.270
They are the evil species that 
pushed us to extinction.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.770
<b>Washima Komandorski 
Sirenia Dugongidae Hydrodamalis gigas</b>

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.770
Humans must be wiped out themselves!

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.800
We are the ones who have 
assembled to save the world...

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:55.800
<b>Hacho Atlas 
Carnivora Felidae Panthera leo leo</b>

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:56.320
The!

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:56.700
Extinct!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:57.130
Species!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:57.670
Alliance!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:00.380
Team EX!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:02.300
Do it with us, Anetani-kun.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:03.530
It's too embarrassing.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.470
That kind of thing makes you sound human!

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.770
I'm not human.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:09.100
Boss!

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.710
Sir!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.800
Well, An?

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:17.150
Do you think you'll be able to 
lead the humans to extinction?

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.810
I think there's a chance.

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.210
Glad to hear it.

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:27.340
Make sure you get it right.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.190
Yes, sir.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.570
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:02.570
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.880
The men's battle to be number 
one with the ladies,

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.490
the Impala Tournament...

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.740
will now begin!

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:15.000
And our first rutting male is... this guy!

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:18.210
Wait, a lion?!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.040
I am an impala!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.250
B-But...

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:25.210
No one wants to face you.

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:27.260
I will face him.

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.580
Father!

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:37.270
King-kun, I called you here because 
I wanted to compete man-to-man.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.770
I'm going to find out whether you're a male...

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.790
who's worthy of my daughter!

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>Male impalas clash their horns 
together in contests of strength.</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:49.940
<i>Their battles are so intense that</i>

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:54.080
<i>they sometimes fight off lions 
that try to attack them...</i>

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:56.160
<i>or not.</i>

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:58.080
Th-The winner is King!

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.110
Th-This means Shiho-dono is now mine.

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.410
Dad...

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:04.420
I-I won't approve of this.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:09.590
Do you think that you, 
a lion, can make Shiho happy?

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:12.600
I do not know.

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:16.010
But I can live by her side.

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:20.100
Live with her, spend my days with her...

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:24.460
And when the day comes that I pass on,

00:22:26.050 --> 00:22:28.440
I will become the dirt that nurtures the grass,

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:30.110
and continue to protect her.

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:33.200
Always... for all eternity.

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:41.030
Dear...

00:22:42.220 --> 00:22:43.890
Let's give them this.

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:46.070
You're right.

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:49.910
King-kun...

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:54.030
I was wrong about you.

00:22:54.030 --> 00:22:56.170
You are a true gentleman.

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:57.490
Father...

00:22:58.540 --> 00:22:59.900
Take care of my daughte—

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:01.400
The time has finally come!

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:06.160
Kin-kun! We can finally do it!

00:23:06.160 --> 00:23:08.910
Ever since the moment I 
first saw you, Shiho-dono,

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:11.410
this has been my dream.

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.910
Oh? What's been your dream?

00:23:14.230 --> 00:23:16.450
Copulation, of course!

00:23:15.300 --> 00:23:16.450
<b>S</b>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:22.050
You beast!

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:24.960
Kin-kun!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.520
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:26.090
<b>Yukari here.</b>

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.340
<b>I think I smell something!</b>

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.340
<b>Kurumi here.</b>

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:31.260
<b>That's just the stuff you made, Yukari.</b>

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.180
<b>No, that's not what I meant.</b>

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:33.260
<b>I meant more like something that's targeting the school!</b>

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.050
<b>The Seton Academy Culture Festival is the stage</b>

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:34.930
<b>the stage for a battle between Team EX and the cooking club!!</b>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.560
<b>Yawn... Wake me when things get interesting.</b>

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:38.910
<b>It's going to be interesting from the start! Don't go to sleep!</b>

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 11</b>

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Extinct Species and a Primitive Plot</b>
